      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从宙斯、哈迪斯等8位神祇中选3位组阁，组合近200种神力联动",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Command a roster of 8 legendary deities, including Zeus, Hades, Apollo, and Ares. In every run, you must draft 3 gods to form your divine council. With nearly 200 skill combinations, discovering overpowered synergies is the key to mastering the game.",
